<title>USA: Frisch's promotes board nominees.</title>
<headline>Frisch's promotes board nominees.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frisch's Restaurants Inc said Wednesday it had sent a proxy solicitation letter to its shareholders urging them to vote for its nominees for the board of directors.</p>
<p>It said the letter also urged them to reject two proposals from the Wolverine Partners to amend the company's code of regulations.</p>
<p>The vote will take place at Frisch's annual meeting on October 7.</p>
</text>
